        "text": "Understanding disks and partitions\nUnderstanding disks and partitions is a key asset for any system administrator. Formatting and\npartitioning disks is critical, starting with system installation. Knowing the type of hardware available\non your system is important, and it is therefore imperative to know how to work with it. One of these\nis the disk; let\u2019s look at this in further detail.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Common disk types\n\u2022 Partitioning disks\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
